nk dark:text-ink-dark mb-2 text-2xl leading-7 font-medium">Blazing Fast Inference</h3><p class="text-muted dark:text-muted-dark font-mono text-sm leading-tight text-pretty">Optimized GPU clusters deliver sub-second image generation and up to 4x faster video rendering than alternatives.</p></div><div class="absolute right-0 bottom-0 left-0"><video src="https://d8r3hf.wavespeed.ai/media/videos/1772514874221085877_EeXV9zUm.mp4" width="850" height="360" autoPlay="" muted="" playsInline="" class="w-full scale-105 dark:mix-blend-screen dark:filter-[invert(1)_contrast(1.2)_hue-rotate(180deg)]"></video></div></div></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-4 lg:flex-row"><div class="bg-surface relative h-[380px] w-full shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-xs lg:h-[420px] lg:w-[55%]"><div class="absolute top-6 right-6 left-6 z-10 lg:w-[642px]"><h3 class="text-ink dark:text-ink-dark mb-2 text-2xl leading-7 font-medium">Built for Scale</h3><p class="text-muted dark:text-muted-dark max-w-[400px] font-mono text-sm text-pretty">From a single image to millions of requests — enterprise-grade infrastructure that grows with you, with 99.99% uptime.</p></div><div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0"><video src="https://d8r3hf.wavespeed.ai/media/videos/1772514874218608012_tVKS1bkv.mp4" width="1024" height="360" autoPlay="" muted="" playsInline="" class="scale-105 dark:mix-blend-screen dark:filter-[invert(1)_contrast(1.2)_hue-rotate(180deg)]"></video></div></div><div class="from-surface to-accent-light relative h-[380px] w-full overflow-hidden rounded-xs bg-linear-to-b lg:h-[420px] lg:flex-1"><div class="absolute top-0 right-[-30px] h-[380px] w-[250px] transition-all duration-1000 ease-out lg:top-[-13px] lg:right-0 lg:h-[480px] lg:w-[390px] translate-y-8 opacity-0"><div class="relative size-full "><img alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="object-contain dark:mix-blend-screen dark:filter-[invert(1)_contrast(1.2)_hue-rotate(180deg)]" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:1