Fd8r3hf.wavespeed.ai%2Fmedia%2Fimages%2F1772524591096029684_mzYKeIcA.png&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fd8r3hf.wavespeed.ai%2Fmedia%2Fimages%2F1772524591096029684_mzYKeIcA.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fd8r3hf.wavespeed.ai%2Fmedia%2Fimages%2F1772524591096029684_mzYKeIcA.png&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fd8r3hf.wavespeed.ai%2Fmedia%2Fimages%2F1772524591096029684_mzYKeIcA.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w" src="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fd8r3hf.wavespeed.ai%2Fmedia%2Fimages%2F1772524591096029684_mzYKeIcA.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75"/></div></div><p class="text-ink dark:text-ink-dark relative text-lg leading-normal text-pretty">Many of our users praise the WaveSpeedAI integration ‘The FLUX result is the same, but now it is under 3 seconds’ ‘these are nice guys at wavespeed, beyond helpful’. WaveSpeedAI integration allows us to do one-stop integration to catch up the latest close-source models, it is very important in this competitive environment.</p></div><div class="text-muted dark:text-muted-dark relative font-mono text-sm leading-normal"><p>Liu Liu</p><p>Draw Things</p></div></div><div class="group bg-background dark:bg-panel-dark relative flex w-[300px] shrink-0 flex-col justify-between gap-4 overflow-hidden rounded-xs p-6 transition-shadow duration-300 hover:shadow-[0px_12px_24px_0px_rgba(0,0,0,0.08)] md:w-[480px] md:p-10 dark:hover:shadow-[0px_12px_24px_0px_rgba(0,0,0,0.3)]"><img alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="pointer-events-none object-cover opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-300 group-hover:opacity-100 dark:hidden" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" sizes="100vw" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fd8r3hf.wavespeed.ai%2Fmedia%2Fimages%2F1772524652891319962_kQERazN3.webp&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fd8r3hf.wavespeed.ai%2Fmedia%2Fimages%2F1772524652891319962